# The City on the Edge of Forever: "I -- All artifacts and creatures phase out. Create a 0/1 white Human creature token with
# 'Permanents can't phase in.' II -- You draw two cards and each player loses 2 life. III -- Sacrifice a creature token. If
# you do, you gain 5 life." (CR 702.26b, 121.1, 119.3, 701.21a) Chapter I phases out Bot1's Moxen and Bot2's Memnite too;
# the Human keeps the Memnite out through Bot2's untap step on turn 4. Chapter II draws Bot1 two cards and costs each player
# 2 life. Chapter III sacrifices the Human - nobody may decline - and Bot1 gains 5; with the Human gone, Bot2's Memnite
# phases in on turn 8.

